concept :the_control_series do
  name "The Control Series"
  aka "对照号", "the numbers"
  tags :ecology, :legibility, :locality, :biotech
  prominence :marginal

  prose <<~PROSE
    What a coring bench compares a core against. Fungi that have lived with a tree for as long as anyone has counted also build closed structures through its outer rings, and a bench that could not separate those from the #{ref :the_others, "Others"}' work would condemn every stand it walked. The series numbers them: one number for one structure, made by one named organism, with the tree, the stem's diameter and the season on the same line.

    A number is issued only against a pair. The bench cutting the original takes the wood carrying the structure and the organism that made it out of the same stem within the hour, and the two halves carry the one number. A structure with no organism beside it is never numbered. It is entered as an unknown, and the series publishes its count of unknowns for the year alongside the numbers it added.
  PROSE

  prose <<~PROSE, section: :operations, heading: "How A File Cites A Number"
    A core sheet on the #{ref :the_amur_line, "Amur"} enters each closed structure it found as a number or as an unknown. A cited number means the reading bench had #{ref :control_billets, "the number's wood"} on the drawer in front of it and matched the structure to the billet's faced end. A structure entered as an unknown counts toward a compartment's threshold; a cited number does not.

    #{ref :tangwang_post, "Tangwang Post"}'s reach cited a hundred and forty-one numbers in the current register year and entered thirty-eight unknowns. Two of the thirty-eight came out of a compartment the post condemned. #{ref :xie_lanting, "Xie Lanting"} sends a drawing, a billet request and, where the tree can spare it, a second core south for every unknown she enters, and hears back on about one in six.
  PROSE

  prose <<~PROSE, section: :origin, heading: "Where The Numbers Come From"
    Most of the series was cut in Yunnan. It holds the largest number of separable fungal partners anywhere on the continent, and — the part no other province can supply — households who can say which of the #{ref :the_thousand_minds, "local minds"} did a given piece of work, in which year, on which slope. #{ref :he_zhaolan, "He Zhaolan"} cuts and presses more of the pairs standing in the series than any other hand.

    An attribution enters the line only when a household will stand behind it. A pair whose organism nobody in the valley will name is pressed, kept and left unnumbered, and the presses in Yunnan hold several times more unnumbered pairs than numbered ones.
  PROSE

  prose <<~PROSE, section: :limits, heading: "What Joining Costs The Series"
    When a small mind joins the central network, its work stops being separable from the centre's. The same structures begin appearing in stands where that mind never grew, so the numbers issued against it are frozen: they stay in the books with the year of joining entered beside them, they cannot be cited on a file, and their billets are recalled.

    Four hundred and six numbers are frozen. Line posts keep the recalled billets in the drawer anyway, because a frozen number is still the only wood a bench can set beside a structure it cannot name, and a match against one is grounds for taking twenty more cores rather than for closing a file.

    The #{ref :the_great_root, "Great Root"} runs the integration campaigns and the line service that depends on the series, pays for the cutting in Yunnan and the coring on the Amur out of the same account, and has never held the two questions in one file.
  PROSE

  log "2026-08-09 — A number requires two specimens from one cutting, from the practice of linking a wood collection's sample to a herbarium voucher of the same organism collected in the same event: an identification made off the wood can then be checked against the organism that made it. That decided why Yunnan is the supply — the pairing needs someone present who can attribute the organism, not a larger reference set — and it decided the honest output, an unknown count published beside the additions, the way a diagnostic collection reports what its reference material could not name."
end
